  "summary": {
    "title": "Summary",
    "icon": "",
    "columns": 1,
    "hidden": false,
    "keepTogether": false,
    "startOnNewPage": false,
    "content": "<p>I am a Computational Data Scientist and full-stack developer with a foundational background in Electrical Control Engineering. I focus on building practical, efficiency-driven tools to solve complex technical problems. Having recently completed my Master's—where I specialized in custom deep learning architectures—I thrive at the intersection of data science and systems engineering. Whether I am automating heavy GIS workflows to save months of manual labor, or engineering machine learning frameworks from the ground up, I am a self-driven developer who values functional, high-impact solutions.</p>"
  },
