          "id": "proj-1",
          "hidden": false,
          "name": "Obsidian Mesh Sync Platform",
          "period": "02/08/2026 - Present",
          "website": {
            "url": "https://github.com/gmanprime/obsidian-mesh-sync",
            "label": "GitHub Repository",
            "inlineLink": false
          },
          "description": "<p>Engineered a custom extension for the Obsidian knowledge base functioning as a robust mesh synchronization platform to seamlessly sync vault content and settings. Leveraged local connections, Tailscale VPN bridges, versioned diff states, and automated backups.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "proj-2",
          "hidden": false,
          "name": "Home Server Ingress & Telemetry Network",
          "period": "05/07/2026 - 06/07/2026",
          "website": {
            "url": "",
            "label": "",
            "inlineLink": false
          },
          "description": "<p>Configured and deployed a robust home lab environment using Ubuntu Server and pure Docker containers. Managed secure network ingress using Tailscale VPN pipelines, Cloudflare Tunnels, and custom YAML reverse proxy paths.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "proj-3",
          "hidden": false,
          "name": "U-Net GAN Application for Spatial Super-Resolution",
          "period": "01/09/2024 - 17/06/2026",
          "website": {
            "url": "",
            "label": "",
            "inlineLink": false
          },
          "description": "<p>Developed and optimized a custom deep learning generative adversarial network (U-Net GAN) from scratch using PyTorch. Applied statistical and dynamical interpolation methods to achieve high-fidelity spatial super-resolution of temperature datasets. Engineered custom training loops accelerated via local NVIDIA GPU compute.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "proj-4",
          "hidden": false,
          "name": "Microcontroller-Based Induction Stove",
          "period": "31/12/2020 - 28/02/2021",
          "website": {
            "url": "",
            "label": "",
            "inlineLink": false
          },
          "description": "<p>Designed and implemented an adjustable-frequency and -power induction stove utilizing embedded microcontroller logic. Integrated power electronics and control feedback loops for an efficient thermodynamic heating solution.</p>"
        }
      ]
